A||N||4||mbramble||Quick Sunroof Gasket Question||||1||
Z||000000||mbramble||11-18-2000||02:15 PM||||Just received a new gasket that I ordered from The Fiero Store.  Was half way thru putting it on when it seemed to me that the two long sides look a little different as far as the depression for the glass to sit in.  Looked at my old one and noticed that it has a yellow rectangle painted at the center of one of the long sides.  Pulled the new one off and it has the same yellow marking.<P>Does this mark show a specific orientation for mounting or is it just a 'model code' to tell it from gaskets for other sunroofs???<P>TIA,<BR>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||2xsess||11-18-2000||06:59 PM||||Mike, I've heard other people talking about installing new sunroof gaskets. There is a front and rear to them, be careful that you don't install it backwards. <P>That's all the wisdom I have to share, it's raining and dark here or I'd run out and see where the yellow square is on mine.<P>Good Luck,<BR>Jeff||||reg||1
Z||000002||mbramble||11-18-2000||07:40 PM||||Thanks for the info. <P>I decided to put the yellow to the front.  That's the way things seemed to fit the best.<P>With the rain we've been having down here the past few days, it shouldn't take too long to figure out if it is correct!!<P><BR>I just saw another thread that talked about drilling holes in each of the corners, uder the gasket.  May look at doing that....<P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||11-18-2000||09:42 PM||||When I got my new seal from the Fiero Store  a few years ago there was a small note that said the yellow mark goes to the front of the car.||||reg||1
Z||000004||mbramble||11-18-2000||10:07 PM||||Confirmation that I made the right choice!!  Thanks very much.  There was no note with my gasket.<P>The differences on the long sides are very subtle.  I called my son out to look at it, and without us knowing anything about the yellow mark, we determined that it looked as if it should go to the front.<P>That may be the reason that the used one I got when I bought the sunroof leaks.  Being old, any differences were not apparent and I may well have put it on wrong.<P>My son just took the car out so if he comes home dry, we should know it is right!!!||||reg||1
